{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "享", "id": "享"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "先生", "id": "先生"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "懷", "id": "懷"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "紾", "id": "紾"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "處", "id": "處"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "說", "id": "說"}, {"form": "識", "id": "識"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6990819160797599, "source": "親", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.483578875227933, "source": "人", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8957922103258141, "source": "人", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 1.706722426542143, "source": "人", "target": "懷"}, {"weight": 1.3012573184339784, "source": "人", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.3012573184339784, "source": "人", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.5889393908857594, "source": "人", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 1.9944044989939238, "source": "人", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 0.7416415304985559, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0135752459821976, "source": "人", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.8957922103258141, "source": "人", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 0.6081101378740331, "source": "人", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.3012573184339784, "source": "人", "target": "識"}, {"weight": 0.38496658655982335, "source": "人", "target": "惡"}, {"weight":